From 73604e9c68e7eaf28ee2bc7483f127780ee1be64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthias Beckert <matthias.beckert@elektrobit.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:51:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] debsbom: add Cargo Static-Built-Using SBOM support

Parse exact crate versions from Static-Built-Using, represent them as Cargo
PURLs, and emit static-link relationships in SPDX and CycloneDX. Ensure Cargo
components are present when SBOMs are generated from dpkg status data.
---
